{"id":"a0513770c85b66e3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-cor-chain-condition.md","title":"Chain Condition Corollary","display":"cor-chain-condition — Chain Condition Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-chain-condition","aliases":["58-cor-chain-condition"],"display":"cor-chain-condition — Chain Condition Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-chain-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-chain-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-chain-condition — Chain Condition Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" href=\"?note=1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},A\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\\)</span> (c.c.c. predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" href=\"?note=1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\\)</span> (antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span> (injection witnessing countability)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}chain-condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}chain-condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The c.c.c. bounds antichains, not the cardinality of the whole poset.</li>\n<li>Arbitrarily large linear orders are c.c.c., so the former continuum-size conclusion was false.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S$ (c.c.c. predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Antichain}_S$ (antichain predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}chain-condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists i:A\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-cor-chain-condition.md|58-cor-chain-condition]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e","b98049bc73009c64"]}